"Artifact limitations. The present package is executable in the supplied environment but does not containerize operating-system dependencies or guarantee bitwise-identical floating-point rendering. The scoped wheel-hash lock and checksum manifest are supplied; a built container image, rights-cleared artifact license and archival DOI remain absent.",
"Data availability statement. The artifact includes simulator data and scripts; the local HTTP study includes 72 single-step, 135 three-step, and 35 inventory run rows, event traces, summaries, source, and protocol digests. The Tier 2 runner and held-out task bank are supplied, but no live-model outcome is reported. No proprietary or personal dataset is used. Future live-model traces will be filtered for provider terms and sensitive content before release.",
